WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:07.680
It's a real real pleasure to be with you&nbsp;
today to celebrate the pan-european launch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:14.320
of the new erasmus plus program&nbsp;
– the jewel in europe's crown.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.200
Erasmus it's the eu exchange program&nbsp;
that some european commissioners&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.840
love to imagine as a european institution&nbsp;
that can create perfect europeans

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:29.600
Since its start in the late 1980s erasmus&nbsp;
has moved millions of european students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:36.400
across europe's borders, and in 2021 erasmus plus,&nbsp;
the umbrella term for the eu's education program&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.800
that covers the erasmus exchange program,&nbsp;
saw a substantial increase in its budget&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.800
from about 14.7 billion euros spread over six&nbsp;
years to 26.2 billion spread over another.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:53.200
Besides providing opportunities to study abroad&nbsp;
and potentially improving someone's job prospects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.640
the erasmus exchange program has&nbsp;
often been regarded as one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.320
most effective institutions for&nbsp;
producing a pan-european identity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.080
but whether this actually happens&nbsp;
is much less clear than it seems.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:09.520
The creation of a european identity through&nbsp;
erasmus has been coined the erasmus effect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:14.240
if contact between different europeans exist&nbsp;
then a group identity will possibly follow.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:19.760
However, the problem with this theory is that&nbsp;
erasmus attracts a type of student that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:24.720
already less likely to be impacted by erasmus&nbsp;
when it comes to producing a european identity.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:28.960
Those participating in erasmus are&nbsp;
already likely to identify as european&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.360
before their exchange making the&nbsp;
erasmus effect relatively negligible.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:38.400
Those coming from a lower rung of education,&nbsp;
as a result not able to participate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:42.720
are less likely to identify as european&nbsp;
and are more likely to be euroskeptic.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:48.720
It's not that erasmus doesn't have an effect on&nbsp;
creating a european identity, but the people who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:54.160
are more likely to be affected by erasmus are less&nbsp;
likely to be in a position where they will be.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.800
However this may also be temporary.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.280
Last wednesday at the state of&nbsp;
the union Ursula von der Leyen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:06.720
announced the eu's plans for ALMA a european&nbsp;
exchange program targeted towards the unemployed.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:12.480
The idea of extending european exchange to a&nbsp;
different level besides university education&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:15.360
is not new and it seems like the tide is turning

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.680
The netherlands education levels are split&nbsp;
between mbo, hbo, and wo. MBOers usually pursue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:28.960
vocational education and are more euroskeptic&nbsp;
and WOers usually pursue university and are less.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:33.520
Naturally WOers were the ones who&nbsp;
usually did the erasmus exchange,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:38.080
but the amount of MBO students abroad with&nbsp;
help from eu grants has also been increasing.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:43.200
This increased movement has been encouraged&nbsp;
and Alexander Pechthold, the former dutch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:49.200
leader of D77 said that MBO students should have&nbsp;
better access to european exchange programs.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:54.880
Europe is no game for the happy few. It needs to&nbsp;
show that it's absolutely necessary for all of us.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:03:00.880
You can also see other examples like Volt&nbsp;
Netherlands explicitly pushing to broaden erasmus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:06.080
plus for MBO and HBO students as one of their&nbsp;
policy standpoints in the last dutch election.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.120
Evaluations have shown that the early&nbsp;
erasmus plus program was able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:16.160
facilitate a european identity among a&nbsp;
sample of vocational students – with 66&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:21.440
feeling more european after and over 72 percent&nbsp;
declaring to have a larger interest in the eu.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.800
With the set goal of reaching 10&nbsp;
million more students, erasmus plus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:31.360
over the course of 2021 and 2027&nbsp;
is set to focus more on inclusion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:37.600
and the new program is doubling the funding for&nbsp;
vocational education from 2.9 million to up to 4.4

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:42.880
Whether this new more inclusive erasmus&nbsp;
budget plus the additional ALMA program&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:47.440
announced this year will actually produce&nbsp;
a larger european identity among europeans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:51.040
who feel that connection the least&nbsp;
is honestly difficult to determine.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:56.800
But whether this is part of the european union's&nbsp;
goal of producing a stronger european identity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:58.560
that's undeniable.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:04.240
Our ultimate goal should be&nbsp;
that erasmus is not become&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:08.560
an option but a fundamental&nbsp;
right for all europeans.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:12.400
This new reinforced robust erasmus plus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:27.840
will be key to support our model of&nbsp;
society and our european way of life.

